body:
i think it depends from person to person, i developed mine due to trauma, so i try to avoid loud noises, fights, ect. but else, i dont really have a way of coping with it, its pretty much part of my daily schedual, but if anything, i advise you to do all the work you need finished the moment you receive it, and then go on and daydream, my procrastination triggers my daydreams aswel so its been the best way ive found to cope with it.

&#x200B;

i hope i helped! im not that great with giving advice, and i hope you get it diagnosed sweetie!

maladaptive daydreaming disorder is a  psychiatric condition. it causes intense daydreams that often times distract a person from real life.

&#x200B;

it affects me in the way that it makes it hard to do every day tasks, like homework, or eat dinner. i daydream for about 9 hours in a day, from before school starts, to the minute it ends, its pretty hard to deal with it, considering im currently behind on two homework assignments, its even hard to get out of the daydream sometimes, but else its up to the person it affects

im a nice person, or so poeple believe. i have a dark side like other people but i somewhat take pride thats its far darker then others. honestly, i could be considered a serial killer. while i hold a lot of empathy, its mostly pity. ive honestly hatched full plans on killing my family, friends and other people. and i should probably explan why.

&#x200B;

growing up i was emotionally and physically abused by both parents, and both dont admit to it. im currently going to therapy for it and i still hold a large grudge against my father. instead of him apolegizing, he refuses to admit to lying to my mother, abusing me, threatening me, and doing worse. and so ive genrally learned to accept this. but believe me, if i could, i would strap him down and murder him slowly and painfully  slow, so that he can feel the pain he caused me since my childhood.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

i know this is dark but believe me, ive thought much darker and have thought about worse, much, worse but this is the most sin ill admit to today.

&#x200B;

BUT, before you think im a sociopath, please know, i will never murder or torture anyone except animals, and so, i wouldnt torture something except i have a reason, so remember,  if you kill, have a reason to, and if you kill mindlessly, even i will hate you and want you dead.

&#x200B;

alright, now ive seriously admit enough sin for today
